<title>THAILAND: Port conditions update - Thailand - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Thailand - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>THAILAND, March 28 - Bangkok - Berthing delay for general cargo and timber vessels nil to three days during last week.</p>
